etter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">:</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -108.5pt; font-size: 14pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; color: rgb(0, 0, 255);\">2025.09.22.(월)~09.24.(수)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 108.5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -108.5pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -108.5pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 108.5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -108.5pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -108.5pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">2.</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"text-indent: -108.5pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">신청자격: 2학년 이상 재학생(2025학년도 2학기 기준)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 108.5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -108.5pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -108.5pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 108.5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -108.5pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -108.5pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: bold; font-size: 14pt;\">3. 신청경로</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -108.5pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">:</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -108.5pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-size: 14pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">Onekit-</span><span style=\"text-indent: -108.5pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-size: 14pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">통합정보시스템</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -108.5pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-size: 14pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">-</span><span style=\"text-indent: -108.5pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-size: 14pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">학적</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -108.5pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-size: 14pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">-</span><span style=\"text-indent: -108.5pt; color: rgb(9, 0, 255); font-size: 14pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">이수과정신청및포기</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 108.5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -108.5pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 108.5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -108.5pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">4.</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"text-indent: -80.6pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 14pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\">신청 방법</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 108.5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -108.5pt;\"><span style=\"text-indent: -80.6pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 14pt; font-family: Gulim, 굴림, AppleGothic, sans-serif; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; - 추가이수과정 신청목록 옆 신규 클릭</span></span><span style=\"text-indent: -80.6pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 14pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">→이수과정구분을 부전공으로 선택</span><span style=\"text-indent: -80.6pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-size: 14pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\">→대상교육과정구분(부전공학과) 선택</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 18.6667px; font-weight: 700; text-indent: -107.467px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">→이수 신청 반드시 클릭</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 108.5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -108.5pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: -98.5pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; ※</span><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp;저장만 할 경우 신청이 처리되지 않으며, 반드시 '이수신청'을 클릭해야 신청 완료됨</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 108.5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -108.5pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><br></span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 108.5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); word-break: break-all; text-indent: -108.5pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: 휴먼명조; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">5.</span><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt; color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">&nbsp;신청학과 및 허용인원</span></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 108.5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5; word-break: break-all; text-indent: -108.5pt;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); text-indent: -33.6pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -33.6pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><font color=\"#212121\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">.</span></font><font color=\"#ff0000\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">&nbsp;신청학과: 붙임 [별표]</span></font></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 108.5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5; word-break: break-all; text-indent: -108.5pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"text-indent: -33.6pt; font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 14pt;\"><font color=\"#ff0000\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51);\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"> 나. 허용인원: 전공정원(입학정원)의 100% 이내에서 선발</span></span></font></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 108.5pt; padding-top: 0px; font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5; word-break: break-all; text-indent: -108.5pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; font-family: &quot;맑은 고딕&quot;; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 108.5pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5; word-break: break-all; text-indent: -108.5pt;\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><b><b>6. 선발 확정</b>: 2025. 9. 30.(화) [예정]</b></span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 108.5pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5; word-break: break-all; text-indent: -108.5pt;\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\"><b><br></b></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 108.5pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5; word-break: break-all; text-indent: -108.5pt;\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\"><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\"><b><b>7. 부전공 신청자의 과목이수</b></b></span></font></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 108.5pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5; word-break: break-all; text-indent: -108.5pt;\"><font face=\"맑은 고딕\"><b><span style=\"font-family: Verdana, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">&nbsp; 가. 부전공 학과의 전공 교과목 중 지정필수 9학점 이상을 포함한 21학점 이상을 이수</span></b></font></p><p class=\"0\" st